Package: magmaanlab
Title: Methods-development R bindings for the magmaan C++ SEM library
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Jonas", "Moss", email = "jonas.moss@bi.no", role = c("aut", "cre"))
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
LinkingTo: Rcpp, RcppEigen, nloptr
Imports: Rcpp, nloptr
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0), lavaan
Config/testthat/edition: 3
SystemRequirements: C++23, NLopt (a system NLopt, or the bundled NLopt from the
    nloptr package, which is used automatically when no system NLopt is found)
Description: Thin Rcpp wrappers exposing magmaan's C++ functions for
    methods development and research, including frontier methods. The
    opinionated one-call package for ordinary users is 'magmaan', which
    builds on this one. Self-contained: the C++ core (plus the vendored PORT and
    QUADPACK routines) is compiled from sources vendored under cpp/src/ and linked
    against a system NLopt, so the package installs without CMake or a prebuilt
    library. Not CRAN-bound.
